    "seoDescription": "Prompt-to-product operations analysis with sources, charts and an ALTOS LAB editorial lens for how teams can turn prompts into versions, evals and…",
    "excerpt": "Prompt-to-product operations looks like a technology story, but the harder question is where teams misread adoption risk, timing and accountability.",
